00:33:37,991 --> 00:33:41,703
Good. Good.
That's commendable.

517
00:33:45,707 --> 00:33:47,292
You get a reportfrom the M.E.?

518
00:33:47,751 --> 00:33:49,920
Sure did.

519
00:33:51,212 --> 00:33:53,256
