520
00:33:53,715 --> 00:33:55,216
You got a problem with me?

521
00:33:55,675 --> 00:33:59,095
If you showed up andfound me
stepping on your crime scene...

522
00:33:59,554 --> 00:34:01,723
and remember, itwas
my crime scene yesterday...

523
