534
00:34:45,809 --> 00:34:46,851
and thought maybe
itwas a lead.

535
00:34:47,310 --> 00:34:48,520
Thought maybe
she saw something.

536
00:34:48,979 --> 00:34:51,982
Why would they
have taken the trouble...

537
