Maybe I'll learn something.

553
00:35:44,117 --> 00:35:45,327
This isn't
homicide school, kid.

554
00:35:45,785 --> 00:35:48,622
But if you wantto help,
take that.

555
00:35:49,080 --> 00:35:50,373
What's this?

556
00:35:50,832 --> 00:35:53,126
The matching set
