557
00:35:59,424 --> 00:36:01,426
This is our second day
in America.

558
00:36:01,885 --> 00:36:03,553
First day was very exciting...

559
00:36:04,012 --> 00:36:05,847
full of thrills and chills.

560
00:36:06,306 --> 00:36:09,768
Over here is the co-star
