but in this joint,
they could be anybody's.

588
00:37:28,013 --> 00:37:33,476
Anybody take a piss lately?
Checkthe toilet seat.

589
00:37:33,935 --> 00:37:36,646
Only one guy checked in?

590
00:37:44,696 --> 00:37:46,489
You wantto go
to homicide school?

591
