601
00:38:16,311 --> 00:38:18,229
Could be. Then we'd probably
find it somewhere.

602
00:38:18,688 --> 00:38:19,898
I thinkwe alreadyfound it.

603
00:38:20,357 --> 00:38:23,693
There was only one phone call
