769
00:49:17,681 --> 00:49:18,723
That's all I can tell you.

770
00:49:19,182 --> 00:49:20,684
All right.
Eddie, are you all right?

771
00:49:21,142 --> 00:49:22,686
Not a good time.

772
00:49:23,144 --> 00:49:24,771
